[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]陈寿评语[/font][/b]


卷末评语全文：


[indent][color=#666666]┃ 评曰：[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "桓阶", "cat": "people"}]桓阶[/url][/color]识睹成败，才周当世；[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陈群", "cat": "people"}]陈群[/url][/color]动仗名义，有清流雅望。泰弘济简至，允克堂构矣。魏世事统台阁，重内轻外，故八座尚书，即古六卿之任也。陈、徐、卫、卢，久居斯位，[color=#000000]矫、宣刚断骨鲠，臻、毓规鉴清理[/color]，咸不忝厥职云。[/color][/indent]


说明：

[indent]•  "矫、宣"= [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "陈矫", "cat": "people"}]陈矫[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "徐宣", "cat": "people"}]徐宣[/url][/color]（刚断骨鲠）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  "臻、毓"= [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "卫臻", "cat": "people"}]卫臻[/url][/color]、卢毓（规鉴清理）[/indent]
